ade by some tense, overexcited airsmen. Ufologists and conspiracy theorists, however, claim that the LA military were actually engaged with extraterrestrial aircraft, and the military and government were trying to cover it up.<br /> <br /> There's also the Roswell incident that also featured a flying object initially described as a &quot;flying disc&quot; and that the military later claimed that it was just a weather balloon but that Ufologists and conspiracy theorist also claim was an alien craft, but that happened in 1947, a year after the announced timeframe of this Era. So...eh.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-06T05:12:46-07:00","id":1125548,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Second Chances</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1125434-golden-age-of-science-fiction-de2?p=1125449#post1125449\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> The one who starterd a bet with the writer of Stranger In A Strange Land as to who could start a religion first? And the other guy backed out because Hubbard was too intense? <br /> <br /> Yes he is.</div> </div> </div> </div> I hope the founding of scientology is in it!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"use